    "body": "I _think_ I fixed up the comment about referencing the members. But I want to understand the `i.e.,` comment better. I understand that environment is a subset of all environment settings objects, but still I believe the only two places where an environment is considered _potential_ is when it is a reserved environment or reserved client, as in my `i.e.,` enumeration. That is, the `i.e.,` is referencing \"potential\", not the overall environment dfn.\r\n\r\n(Also please ignore if the wrapping is off... I did this on the new github.dev UI to experiment with it; if it's malformed I'll fix it later on a real computer)",
